# Turbo's remote cache (Vercel), read by packages/config/local/check.sh for the
# pre-commit hook. CI sets the same two as a secret and a variable.
# The token: vercel.com/account/tokens, expiration "No Expiration", scoped to
# the team. It is a standing credential: keep this file local (it is
# gitignored), `chmod 600 .env`, and revoke the token on Vercel if it leaks.
TURBO_TEAM=
TURBO_TOKEN=
